{"title":"우리 삼촌은 월드스타","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=lY7Ar/hAdNSGw79x/GlDjwplOu8x5CyudIU2c31&filename=th3","synopsis":"조카와 어머니를 책임져야만 했기에,\n어린시절 꿈이었던 가수를 포기해야만 했던 청년가장 우진.\n\n《 당신의 꿈을 이뤄 드리겠습니다. 수락하시겠습니까? 》\n\n어느 날부터 스팸문자처럼 날아 온 『드림 프로그램』.\n그렇게 하늘에서 떨어진 별똥별을 삼키게 되고, \n특별한 인공지능의 보조 아래 꿈을 이루어주는 드림 프로젝트가 시작된다.\n\n흙수저에서 세계적인 스타가 되기까지,\n어머니의 아들이자, 한 소녀의 삼촌인 우진의 최고의 엔터테인먼트가 되기 위한 화려한 인생이 시작 된다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":174,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":100,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":152,"change":{"type":"down","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":234,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":229,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":203,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":198,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":144,"change":{"type":"up","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":162,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":109,"change":{"type":"up","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":157,"change":{"type":"down","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":264,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":220,"change":{"type":"up","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":251,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":119,"change":{"type":"up","amount":132}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":156,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":148,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":155,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":112,"change":{"type":"up","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":142,"change":{"type":"down","amount":30}},{"date":"2026